    "collateral_ratio_basis": "Par plus surplus buffer: 100 + (surplus_buffer / total_supply x 100). \u26a0\ufe0f NOT total_backing / total_supply \u2014 that quotient is ~100.11% and carries the OPPOSITE SIGN, because surplus_deficit here is Sky's vow surplus buffer (vat.dai(vow) - vat.sin(vow)), not backing minus supply. Every USDS is minted 1:1 against a debt position, so raw par coverage is ~100% by construction and the real signal is the buffer. Reads below 100 on a vow deficit even while assets exceed liabilities. Not comparable to a backing-over-supply ratio.",
